---------------------------------
-  StampVault: Africa (part 1)  -
---------------------------------

This is part of the stamp data used by StampVault: https://github.com/StampVault/StampVault.git

This repository contains part 1 of 2 of the data for Africa. To use this data with StampVault, clone this repository into the `stamps/data` subdirectory of StampVault.

See the documentation of StampVault for more information: https://github.com/StampVault/StampVault.git
